## goal
Implement first renovacion subproject: prompt-only agent ecosystem for orchestrator + subagents, teams.yaml, prompt-level contracts, repo ignore/config for project outputs. Explicitly exclude Python validation/calculation/spec/memory tools.

## assumptions
- Source of truth is `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-04-22-renovacion-agent-ecosystem-design.md`.
- Existing `.pi/.agents/renovacion/index.md` is empty and can be ignored or replaced by new target layout.
- Agent runtime will load markdown prompts from `.pi/agents/renovacion-agent/` plus `.pi/agents/teams.yaml` as defined in spec.
- Filesystem contract is documentation + repo config only in this phase; no runtime enforcement code yet.
- Bootstrap defaults for `AURORA GMR` live inside prompt contracts, not code.

## constraints
- No Python tools, calc engine, spec engine, memory generator impl, or external memory/tool integrations.
- Subagents must not talk directly to user; orchestrator is only user-facing agent.
- Prompt contracts must use shared request/response schema and status vocabulary from spec.
- Repo changes must support versioned project artifacts except generated PDFs.
- Plan must preserve hybrid routing: `desarrollador=true` default, production flow available.

